{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-114","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：可公度量与截差无理线段与二项无理线段","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by an apotome and the binomial straight line the terms of which are commensurable with the terms of the apotome and in the same ratio, the side of the area is rational.","book":10,"number":114,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":114,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","contentId":"euclid-10-114","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d131afccf59e74bb0dd065a16f300949b762ab8b7f166c4730083e05c928202","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-114.statement","euclid-10-114.construction.1","euclid-10-114.construction.2","euclid-10-114.proof.1","euclid-10-114.construction.3","euclid-10-114.proof.2","euclid-10-114.proof.3","euclid-10-114.proof.4","euclid-10-114.proof.5","euclid-10-114.proof.6","euclid-10-114.proof.7","euclid-10-114.proof.8","euclid-10-114.proof.9","euclid-10-114.proof.10","euclid-10-114.conclusion","euclid-10-114.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-114.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99f96c2cec95f0970352353f10d4bd0d1cf08abb92389f589ab82903a6b0dca5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by an apotome and the binomial straight line the terms of which are commensurable with the terms of the apotome and in the same ratio, the side of the area is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个区域由截差无理线段和二项无理线段直线组成,其条件为可公度,其比例为截差无理线段,则区域一侧为有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13322901a6b4f84c60900664c3bacb1111cf42bddf62acbc8e2bb73091cec918","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let an area, the rectangle AB, CD, be contained by the apotome AB and the binomial straight line CD, and let CE be the greater term of the latter; let the terms CE, ED of the binomial straight line be commensurable with the terms AF, FB of the apotome and in the same ratio; and let the side of the rectangle AB, CD be G; I say that G is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有一个区域,矩形 AB,CD,二项无理线段直线CD,CE直线的长度较大,二项无理线段直线的长度为CE;二项无理线段直线的长度为CE,ED,截差无理线段的长度为AF,FB,比例相同;矩形 AB,CD直线的边段为G;我说,G是有理；上述对应量可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bfcc9006630e00ba55bee420de1d37f2001602912c7ad90919131a24adc4c724","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a rational straight line H be set out, and to CD let there be applied a rectangle equal to the square on H and producing KL as breadth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出有理线段 H,CD,适用矩形,等于H正方形,宽度扩大KL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"280677a7059874b557610a9edcdd40aa6207a9c9eba400a3b5bae69d59ad6f4e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore KL is an apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以KL是截差无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2751f8f96b22a5b99f11a0f71d9e4e25a15268740d41551b532cc9c596509380","citations":["euclid-10-112"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let its terms be KM, ML commensurable with the terms CE, ED of the binomial straight line and in the same ratio. [[X. 112](/principles/euclid-10-112)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其任期为KM,ML,可公度,可公度,,二项无理线段直线中的CE,ED,比例相同。 [[X. 112](/principles/euclid-10-112)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f25943145776b686e3958289769554cd9ddef5658cd11bd8209d439ccbad09ed","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CE, ED are also commensurable with AF, FB and in the same ratio; therefore, as AF is to FB, so is KM to ML."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CE,ED也是可公度,AF,FB,比例相同;因此,AF对FB的比等于KM对ML的比；AF 与 FB 之比等于 KM 与 ML 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee287d7aefb78ee3baff6fff1b2a5f8783619c7af3f5754ea127ad75de204462","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, alternately, as AF is to KM, so is BF to LM; therefore also the remainder AB is to the remainder KL as AF is to KM. [[V. 19](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AF比KM的比例则等于BF比LM;因此,其余AB等于KL,因为AF比KM；AF 与 KM 之比等于 BF 与 LM 之比。 [[V. 19](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b0d54a22438ebe899be05516bde84519babbe57d95f1b744a9bfd254d160b19d","citations":["euclid-10-12","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AF is commensurable with KM; [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] therefore AB is also commensurable with KL. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AF是可公度,KM;因此,AB也是可公度,KL。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b5db647b8a4e666c27de2a85869958fc8a2be264a957ed1d230ccc66e0820392","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as AB is to KL, so is the rectangle CD, AB to the rectangle CD, KL; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore the rectangle CD, AB is also commensurable with the rectangle CD, KL. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是KL,矩形,CD,AB是矩形,CD,KL,矩形,矩形,CD,KL,矩形,矩形,AB也是可公度,矩形,CD,KL；上述对应量具有相同的比例关系。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14a02a7a0ede9a7dc745588375900fde12d71d7fd4277f7c67edae643d13f130","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle CD, KL is equal to the square on H; therefore the rectangle CD, AB is commensurable with the square on H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,矩形 CD,KL等于H的正方形;因此,矩形 CD,AB是可公度,正方形是H。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f630459794fd8ceb4f27cb8a02513d9b9c9cffb68395f6986e36f9feb657722","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on G is equal to the rectangle CD, AB; therefore the square on G is commensurable with the square on H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但G的正方形等于矩形 CD AB;因此,G的正方形等于可公度,H的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e2d2c3bcab44c065b1077c52b6990807a7727b942eb3b14bec82308221fc5de","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on H is rational; therefore the square on G is also rational; therefore G is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但H的正方形是有理;G的正方形也是有理;G是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9652dcde1914c6cdae55a3f08724243be78d932803c9f271c18994a7b67c58a7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is the side of the rectangle CD, AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这是矩形、CD,AB的一面"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e82298fe7bd38238f9ed3e5e11804035f141226ef17dda914a06e8e3a22d60c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. And it is made manifest to us by this also that it is possible for a rational area to be contained by irrational straight lines. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"推论,这也向我们表明 有理面积的无理线段是可能的,Q,E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-114.source","contentId":"euclid-10-114","revisionId":"euclid-10-114@raw-3d131afccf59e74b","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc28c97d420e7270141d92bd5166e5ac77ea154b7c1b0a7a04548911c201d670","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-114:euclid-10-112:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-114","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-114.construction.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-112","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114/","sourceLabel":"X. 112"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-114:euclid-5-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-114","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-114.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-19","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114/","sourceLabel":"V. 19"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-114:euclid-10-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-114","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-114.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114/","sourceLabel":"X. 12"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-114:euclid-10-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-114","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-114.proof.4","euclid-10-114.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114/","sourceLabel":"X. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-114:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-114","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-114.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.114/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-114:euclid-10-112:explicit","id":"euclid-10-112","book":10,"number":112,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：可公度量与截差无理线段与二项无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-114:euclid-5-19:explicit","id":"euclid-5-19","book":5,"number":19,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例论","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-114:euclid-10-12:explicit","id":"euclid-10-12","book":10,"number":12,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-114:euclid-10-11:explicit","id":"euclid-10-11","book":10,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"比例关系保持可公度与不可公度","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-114:euclid-6-1:explicit","id":"euclid-6-1","book":6,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"同高三角形与平行四边形的面积比等于底边比","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-irrational","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad ge